## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

{%- if execution_model == "web" %}
- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) 20+
- [pnpm](https://pnpm.io/)
{%- else %}
- [Bun](https://bun.sh/) 1.1+
{%- endif %}
- [just](https://just.systems/)
{%- if execution_model != "cli" %}
- [Docker](https://www.docker.com/) (for dependencies)
{%- endif %}

### Installation

```sh
{%- if execution_model == "web" %}
pnpm install
{%- else %}
bun install
{%- endif %}
cp .env.example .env
```
{% if include_database and database_type == "postgres" %}
### Database

```sh
# Start Postgres
docker compose up -d

# Run migrations
{%- if execution_model == "web" %}
pnpm exec prisma migrate deploy
{%- else %}
bunx prisma migrate deploy
{%- endif %}
```
{% endif %}
### Running
{% if execution_model == "cli" %}
```sh
{{ project_name }} ask "Hello, agent!"
```
{% elif execution_model == "web" %}
```sh
just dev
```

The app will be available at `http://localhost:3000`.
{% else %}
```sh
just dev
```

The API will be available at `http://localhost:3000`. Health check at `http://localhost:3000/healthz`.
{% endif %}

## Development

```sh
# Check formatting and linting
just fmt
just lint

# Fix formatting and linting
just fmt-fix
just lint-fix

# Run type checker
just typecheck
```

## Testing

```sh
# Run unit tests
just test-unit

# Run all tests
just test-all

# Full pre-push check
just gate
```
{% if execution_model != "cli" %}
## Deployment

```sh
# Build Docker image
docker build -t {{ project_name }} .

# Run container
docker run -p 3000:3000 {{ project_name }}
```
